<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contacto - Test de Personalidad</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Verdana', Geneva, sans-serif; 
            background-color: #eef0f1; 
            color: #333; 
            display: flex; 
            flex-direction: column; 
            align-items: center; 
            min-height: 100vh; 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
        }
        .main-content { flex: 1; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 40px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; }
        .contact-container { background-color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); max-width: 550px; width: 100%; padding: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; }
        h1 { margin: 0; color: #444; font-family: 'Verdana', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; }
        p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #666; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .form-group { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #555; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        input[type="text"], input[type="email"], textarea { width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Verdana', sans-serif; font-size: 13px;}
        input[type="text"]:focus, input[type="email"]:focus, textarea :focus { border-color: #777; background-color: #fff; outline: none; }
        textarea { resize: vertical; height: 120px; }
        .buttons-container { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 25px; }
        .action-btn { background-color: #555; color: white; border: none; padding: 14px 30px; font-size: 15px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Verdana', sans-serif; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: background-color 0.2s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
        .action-btn:hover { background-color: #333; }
        .back-btn { background-color: #bbb; color: #333; }
        .back-btn:hover { background-color: #999; color: white; }
        .full-width-info { background-color: #333; color: #ccc; width: 100%; padding: 25px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; border-top: 4px solid #555; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="main-content">
    <div class="contact-container">

        <div class="page-header">
            <h1>Contacto</h1>
        </div>

        <p>¿Tienes dudas, comentarios o sugerencias sobre el sitio? ¡Escríbenos!</p>
        <form onsubmit="alert('¡Mensaje enviado con éxito!'); return false;">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="name">Nombre Completo</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="Ej. Juan Pérez">
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="email">Correo Electrónico</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="ejemplo@correo.com">
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="message">Mensaje</label>
                <textarea id="message" required placeholder="Escribe tu mensaje aquí..."></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="buttons-container">
                <button type="submit" class="action-btn">Enviar Mensaje</button>
                <a href="inicio.html" class="action-btn back-btn">Volver al Inicio</a>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="full-width-info"></div>

</body>
</html>
